:: kidnap {"position":"150,475"}
<<scenery home>>
<<addMinutes 30>>\
You start stalking the $found_kid.age year old kid waiting for the right moment.
<<run Player.removeItem("chloroform")>>
A while later you see the kid standing all alone in a corner. You look around making sure no one sees you and quickly use the chloroform \
on $found_kid.possessive mouth. (<<- Player.has('chloroform') ? Player.getInventory().get('chloroform').count : 'No'>> doses left)

Surprised, the kid takes a deep breath on the chloroform soaked handkerchief. You feel $found_kid.possessive strength quickly running out and \
$found_kid.possessive cute limbs falling right in your arms.

You cover $found_kid.possessive body in a blanket and sneak up back to your home with your new toy.
<<run Person.capture($found_kid)>>
<<keyOption [[Enter the basement|basement]] 🚪>>

:: CandyLure {"position":"250,350"}
<<scenery playground>>
<<addMinutes 3>>\
You sit on the park bench with a candy bar and wait for the $found_kid.age year old $found_kid.title to approach you. It takes a few minutes. But $found_kid.genPronoun finally approaches you.

<<run Player.removeItem("Candy")>>\
"Hi, my name's $found_kid.name and I was wondering if perhaps I can have that candy bar?"

You smile and say, "Unfortunately $found_kid.name, this is all I have on me. BUT, you see that house down the road?" You turn and point to your house.

"Yeah?" says the $found_kid.age yo $found_kid.title.

"Well, that's my house and I have a 30 lb. bag of candy downstairs. If you follow me back. You can help yourself." (<<- Player.has('Candy') ? Player.getInventory().get('Candy').count : 'No'>> pieces left)

"OK!" says the $found_kid.title with SURPRISING Enthusiasm.

The $found_kid.age yo $found_kid.title follows you closely. It takes 6 minutes to reach your house.<<addMinutes 6>>

You and the $found_kid.age yo enter your house. You and $found_kid.pronoun then head into the basement.
As soon as $found_kid.name realizes what's going on $found_kid.genPronoun tries to escape but you quickly grab and chain $found_kid.pronoun to the wall.
<<run Person.capture($found_kid)>>
<<keyOption [[Continue|basement]] ▶>>